box    stone   at 216 5 168 size 14 1.5 14

# tomb at 22,10 1x3 (at 79% of its height, for the camera)
box    stone   at 360 0 184 size 12 7 44 id tomb-10
box    stone   at 360 7 184 size 14 2 46

# tomb at 9,11 1x1 (at 58% of its height, for the camera)
